text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Acidic Soil deals damage to each player equal to the number of lands they control.', 'Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'All creatures are black.', 'All creatures have protection from black.', 'All creatures have protection from red.', 'Arc Lightning deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three targets.', 'As Phyrexian Processor enters the battlefield, pay any amount of life.\n{4}, {T}: Create an X/X black Phyrexian Minion creature token, where X is the life paid as Phyrexian Processor entered the battlefield.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a land.\nDestroy target land.', "At the beginning of each of your main phases, if you haven't added mana with this ability this turn, you may add X mana of any one color, where X is the number of Islands target opponent controls.", "At the beginning of each player's end step, Antagonism deals 2 damage to that player unless one of their opponents was dealt damage this turn.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, if that player controls more lands than each other player, the player creates a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, return to its owner's hand each creature that player controls with power greater than the number of cards in their hand.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player may pay 2 life. If they don't, they return a permanent they control to its owner's hand.", 'At the beginning of the end step, if no creatures are on the battlefield, sacrifice Pestilence.\n{B}: Pestilence deals 1 damage to each creature and each player.', 'At the beginning of the end step, if you control no creatures, sacrifice Thran Quarry.\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'At the beginning of your draw step, draw an additional card.\nAt the beginning of your end step, discard your hand.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, Bulwark deals X damage to target opponent, where X is the number of cards in your hand minus the number of cards in that player's hand.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, Purging Scythe deals 2 damage to the creature with the least toughness. If two or more creatures are tied for least toughness, you choose one of them.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, flip a coin. If you lose the flip, return Scoria Wurm to its owner's hand.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if a player has more life than each other player, the player with the most life gains control of Wild Dogs.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control another nonland permanent, sacrifice Reclusive Wight.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have a card in hand, return Imaginary Pet to its owner's hand.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Contamination unless you sacrifice a creature.\nIf a land is tapped for mana, it produces {B} instead of any other type and amount.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may add {C}{C}. You can't spend this mana to cast spells.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a fungus counter on target nontoken creature.\nWhenever a creature with a fungus counter on it dies, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token for each fungus counter on that creature.\nWhen Sporogenesis leaves the battlefield, remove all fungus counters from all creatures.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a page counter on Barrin's Codex.\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifice Barrin's Codex: Draw X cards, where X is the number of page counters on Barrin's Codex.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a petal counter on Lotus Blossom.\n{T}, Sacrifice Lotus Blossom: Add X mana of any one color, where X is the number of petal counters on Lotus Blossom.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a soot counter on Smokestack.\nAt the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player sacrifices a permanent for each soot counter on Smokestack.", "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a verse counter on Discordant Dirge.\n{B}, Sacrifice Discordant Dirge: Look at target opponent's hand and choose up to X cards from it, where X is the number of verse counters on Discordant Dirge. That player discards those cards.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a verse counter on Lilting Refrain.\nSacrifice Lilting Refrain: Counter target spell unless its controller pays {X}, where X is the number of verse counters on Lilting Refrain.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a verse counter on Midsummer Revel.\n{G}, Sacrifice Midsummer Revel: Create X 3/3 green Beast creature tokens, where X is the number of verse counters on Midsummer Revel.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a verse counter on Recantation.\n{U}, Sacrifice Recantation: Return up to X target permanents to their owners' hands, where X is the number of verse counters on Recantation.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a verse counter on Rumbling Crescendo.\n{R}, Sacrifice Rumbling Crescendo: Destroy up to X target lands, where X is the number of verse counters on Rumbling Crescendo.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a verse counter on Serra's Hymn.\nSacrifice Serra's Hymn: Prevent the next X damage that would be dealt this turn to any number of targets, divided as you choose, where X is the number of verse counters on Serra's Hymn.", "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a verse counter on Serra's Liturgy.\n{W}, Sacrifice Serra's Liturgy: Destroy up to X target artifacts and/or enchantments, where X is the number of verse counters on Serra's Liturgy.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a verse counter on Torch Song.\n{2}{R}, Sacrifice Torch Song: It deals X damage to any target, where X is the number of verse counters on Torch Song.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a verse counter on Vile Requiem.\n{1}{B}, Sacrifice Vile Requiem: Destroy up to X target nonblack creatures, where X is the number of verse counters on Vile Requiem. They can't be regenerated.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a verse counter on War Dance.\nSacrifice War Dance: Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of verse counters on War Dance.', 'Attach target Aura attached to a creature or land to another permanent of that type.', 'Attacking creatures gain first strike until end of turn.', 'Choose a color. Target player reveals their hand and discards all cards of that color.', 'Choose artifact, creature, or land. Tap all untapped permanents of the chosen type target player controls, or untap all tapped permanents of that type that player controls.', 'Choose one —\n• Target player gains 3 life.\n• Prevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', 'Choose two target creature cards in your graveyard. Sacrifice a creature. If you do, return the chosen cards to the battlefield tapped.', 'Corrupt deals damage to any target equal to the number of Swamps you control. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', 'Counter target artifact or enchantment spell.', "Counter target spell unless its controller pays {X}. If that player doesn't, they tap all lands with mana abilities they control and lose all unspent mana.", 'Counter target spell. Untap up to four lands.', 'Create X 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Create three 2/2 white Knight creature tokens. Exile them at the beginning of the next cleanup step.', "Creatures and lands target opponent controls don't untap during their next untap step.", "Creatures can't block.", 'Creatures with flying get -2/-0.', "Creatures without flying can't block this turn.", 'Creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Creatures you control have "Whenever this creature becomes blocked by a creature, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn."', 'Creatures you control have "{T}: Add {G}."', 'Cycling abilities you activate cost up to {2} less to activate.', 'Cycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nFirst strike\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nWhen Wall of Junk blocks, return it to its owner's hand at end of combat. (Return it only if it's on the battlefield.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{3}: Mobile Fort gets +3/-1 until end of turn and can attack this turn as though it didn't have defender. Activate only once each turn.", 'Defender, flying\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by Fog Bank.', 'Destroy all creatures with flying.', 'Destroy all enchantments.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Destroy all lands or all creatures. Creatures destroyed this way can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy each artifact with mana value X or less.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Destroy target creature. Its owner gains 4 life.', 'Destroy target enchantment.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Destroy target land or nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target land.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", 'Destroy two target lands.', 'Discard all the cards in your hand, then draw that many cards.', 'Disorder deals 2 damage to each white creature and each player who controls a white creature.', 'Draw two cards, then discard a card.', 'Drifting Meadow enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {W}.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Each opponent discards two cards.', "Each player can't cast more than one spell each turn.", 'Each player discards their hand, then draws cards equal to the greatest number of cards a player discarded this way.', 'Each player may put an artifact, creature, enchantment, or land card from their hand onto the battlefield.', 'Each player puts a creature card from their graveyard onto the battlefield.', "Each player returns a creature they control to its owner's hand.", 'Each player sacrifices four lands. Wildfire deals 4 damage to each creature.', 'Echo {1}{G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)', 'Echo {1}{G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\n{1}{G}: Regenerate Albino Troll.', 'Echo {2}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)', 'Echo {4}{G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)', 'Echo {4}{R}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Crater Hellion enters the battlefield, it deals 4 damage to each other creature.', 'Echo {G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)', 'Echo {R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)', "Enchant Swamp\nWhen enchanted land becomes tapped, destroy it.\nWhen Spreading Algae is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Spreading Algae to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\nAll damage that would be dealt to you is dealt to enchanted creature instead.', "Enchant creature\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, Parasitic Bond deals 2 damage to that player.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't be blocked.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each Forest you control.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each other creature you control.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+2.\nWhen Brilliant Halo is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Brilliant Halo to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying and shroud. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying and vigilance.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying.\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by enchanted creature this turn dies, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying.\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3 and has trample.\n{G}: Regenerate enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets -1/-1.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets -2/-0.\nWhen Despondency is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Despondency to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has "At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice this creature unless you pay its mana cost."', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: This creature deals 1 damage to any target."', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has flying.\nWhen Launch is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Launch to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\nSacrifice a Forest: Regenerate enchanted creature.\nWhen Fortitude is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Fortitude to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\nWhenever enchanted creature deals combat damage to a player, that player sacrifices a land.', 'Enchant creature\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage to a creature, destroy the other creature.', "Enchant creature\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\nWhen Fiery Mantle is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Fiery Mantle to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature has first strike. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', "Enchant enchantment\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted enchantment's controller, that player loses 2 life unless they pay {2}.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", 'Enchant land\nEnchanted land is an Island.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Enchant land\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional one mana of any color.', 'Enchant permanent\nYou control enchanted permanent.', 'Exile Ill-Gotten Gains. Each player discards their hand, then returns up to three cards from their graveyard to their hand.', 'Exile Time Spiral. Each player shuffles their hand and graveyard into their library, then draws seven cards. You untap up to six lands.', 'Fault Line deals X damage to each creature without flying and each player.', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\nWhenever Order of Yawgmoth deals damage to a player, that player discards a card.", 'First strike', 'First strike\n{1}{B}: Regenerate Sanguine Guard.', 'First strike, haste\nEcho {2}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)', 'Flying\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Drifting Djinn unless you pay {1}{U}.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Flying\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Flying\nDiscard a card: Add {B}.', 'Flying\nEcho {2}{R}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\n{R}: Lightning Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Flying\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Flying\nWhen Abyssal Horror enters the battlefield, target player discards two cards.', "Flying\nWhen Dark Hatchling enters the battlefield, destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", "Flying\nWhen Gilded Drake enters the battlefield, exchange control of Gilded Drake and up to one target creature an opponent controls. If you don't or can't make an exchange, sacrifice Gilded Drake. This ability still resolves if its target becomes illegal.", 'Flying\nWhen Peregrine Drake enters the battlefield, untap up to five lands.', 'Flying\nWhen Spire Owl enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', 'Flying\nWhen you cast a creature spell, sacrifice Skittering Skirge.', 'Flying\nWhenever Ravenous Skirge attacks, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', "Flying\nWhenever Somnophore deals damage to a player, tap target creature that player controls. That creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step for as long as Somnophore remains on the battlefield.", 'Flying\n{T}: Target attacking or blocking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nFirst strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\n{1}{R}: Shivan Hellkite deals 1 damage to any target.", 'Flying, haste', 'Flying, protection from black', 'Flying, protection from red', 'Flying, vigilance\nEcho {2}{W}{W} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)', 'Gain control of all permanents you own. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Goblin Raider can't block.", 'Haste\nEcho {1}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', 'Heat Ray deals X damage to target creature.', 'If a red spell would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals that much damage plus 1 to that permanent or player instead.', 'If a source would deal damage to you, prevent 1 of that damage.', 'If you control a creature, damage that would reduce your life total to less than 1 reduces it to 1 instead.', 'If you would draw a card, you may instead choose land or nonland and reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a card of the chosen kind. Put that card into your hand and put all other cards revealed this way on the bottom of your library in any order.', "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", 'Jagged Lightning deals 3 damage to each of two target creatures.', "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)\nEcho {1}{R}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)", "Nonbasic lands don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", "Okk can't attack unless a creature with greater power also attacks.\nOkk can't block unless a creature with greater power also blocks.", 'Pay half your life, rounded up: Lurking Evil becomes a 4/4 Phyrexian Horror creature with flying.', "Phyrexian Colossus doesn't untap during your untap step.\nPay 8 life: Untap Phyrexian Colossus.\nP